# Design system

Reuse `apps/web/public/brand/` and CareerGenie chrome. Do not invent a second logo or copy CareerGenie’s office photo or sign-in.

- Tokens: ink `#152028`, accent `#0F4C5C`, line `#C5D0D6`, wash `#E8EEF1`.
- Display: Source Serif 4. UI: Source Sans 3. Mono: IBM Plex Mono.
- Sticky frosted header, segmented Home/Labs/Privacy, `WorkspacePanel` glass, `max-w-3xl`.
- Buttons are `rounded-md` teal (`btn-accent`), not apricot pills.
- No email capture, no Sign In.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<button className="rounded-full bg-apricot text-ink">Get Started</button>

// ✅ GOOD
<Link className="btn-accent" href="/labs">
  Open a lab
</Link>
```
